  "description": "ZXing.Net.Mobile is a C#/.NET library based on the open source Barcode Library: ZXing (Zebra Crossing), using the ZXing.Net Port. It works with .NET for Android & iOS. The goal of ZXing.Net.Mobile is to make scanning barcodes as effortless and painless as possible in your own applications.\n\n\t\t\tThe original project is https://github.com/Redth/ZXing.Net.Mobile.\n\t\t\tIt is dead and the successor is https://github.com/Redth/ZXing.Net.MAUI.\n\t\t\tBut if you use .NET Android or iOS instead of MAUI you can't use it.\n\t\t\tThis project is a fork to switch to modern .NET Android/iOS with necessary bugfixes.\n\t\t\tIt is forked from the fork https://github.com/Respawnsive/ZXing.Net.Mobile to have the mentioned fix from https://github.com/Redth/ZXing.Net.Mobile/issues/924#issuecomment-1430058104.",
